sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as odh-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant REST as rest-service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Flight as flight-service<br/>8443/TCP gRPC+TLS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP TLS
    participant DS as Data Source<br/>(varies)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as dc-controller

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,PG: Flow 1: REST API Data Access
        Client->>Gateway: HTTPS/443<br/>Bearer Token
        Gateway->>KRBP: HTTPS/8443<br/>TLS (service-CA)
        KRBP->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(X-Tenant-Id -> namespace)
        K8sAPI-->>KRBP: Allowed/Denied
        KRBP->>REST: HTTP/8080 (localhost)<br/>Passthrough headers
        REST->>PG: SQL/5432<br/>TLS (rustls), Password
        PG-->>REST: Query Results
        REST-->>KRBP: JSON Response
        KRBP-->>Gateway: HTTPS Response
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON Response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over Client,DS: Flow 2: Arrow Flight Data Streaming
        Client->>Gateway: gRPC/443<br/>Bearer Token
        Gateway->>Flight: gRPC/8443<br/>TLS (service-CA)
        Flight->>K8sAPI: TokenReview<br/>(Bearer token validation)
        K8sAPI-->>Flight: Token Valid/Invalid
        Flight->>PG: Metadata Query/5432<br/>TLS (rustls), Password
        PG-->>Flight: Connection Config
        Flight->>DS: Connector Protocol<br/>Per-connector auth
        DS-->>Flight: Raw Data
        Flight-->>Gateway: Arrow RecordBatch Stream
        Gateway-->>Client: gRPC Stream Response
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over Controller,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Controller Reconciliation
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch DataConnectService CRs<br/>HTTPS/6443, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: CR Event
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Read OpenShift APIServer<br/>(TLS profile)
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: TLS Config
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments,<br/>Services, HTTPRoutes,<br/>NetworkPolicies, RBAC
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Reconciled
        Controller->>REST: Seed InitDataConnections<br/>HTTPS/8443, service-CA
        REST-->>Controller: Created
    end
